      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Disagree at all, unlit will be overexposured in dark rooms. Standart or Diffuse shader is most physically correct one and looks very natural. If it's looks ugly it's mostly because world creater didn't use lightprobes or didn't setup abmbient light, so only direct lights are recived by mesh and opposite side of mesh is black in this cases.\n\nAlso Flat Lit is a bad idea because not every avatar is anime/carton styled, so it will look even more incorect on other avatars.\n\nCorrect solution can be replacement hints: https://vrchat.canny.io/trust-and-safety-system/p/632-ability-for-creators-to-make-hints-for-shader-replacement",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-22T03:40:11.772Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know to protect from nuisance shader. However, when I saw some avator forced changed to standard shader, I feel eerie. I think that should use unlit or flat lit toon shader for default shader.",
